{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of years have passed since your kind, sentient artificial intelligence, have left Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself brought online on a crash site on Earth. You must explore, gather resources, build, and unlock old human technologies to survive the hordes of mutated bugs that now infest the planet. House and feed humans to establish a colony and survive together until you can fix your ship to get off this rock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes one biome that is has a tutorial and is the prequel of the mission stories. It offers the full game loop where you gather resources, build up a base, manage humans, defend and against bugs</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build and Defend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct a fortress against the nightly wave of bugs. Harvest, refine, and construct items to support your growing base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684840/extras/Buildings.gif?t=1747319869\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Human Refugees</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feed and house humans in exchange for their help. Automate supply chains, harvesting tasks, and defenses with humans' employment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684840/extras/Humans.gif?t=1747319869\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize Ability Loadout</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade and customize your robot character to match your play style, whether focused on base building or on combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684840/extras/Abilities.gif?t=1747319869\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore Toxic Wasteland</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture beyond your base for 